<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>مساعد البرمجة المحلي - AI Code Assistant</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Monaco Editor (محرر VS Code) -->
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/monaco-editor/0.34.1/min/vs/loader.min.js"></script>
    <!-- TensorFlow.js -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tensorflow/tfjs@3.18.0/dist/tf.min.js"></script>
    <!-- Transformers.js -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@xenova/transformers@2.6.0"></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #4361ee;
            --secondary: #3a0ca3;
            --success: #4cc9f0;
            --warning: #f8961e;
            --error: #f94144;
            --dark: #1a1a2e;
            --light: #f8f9fa;
            --code-bg: #1e1e1e;
        }
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
            color: var(--light);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 350px 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            height: 95vh;
        }
        
        .sidebar {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 25px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            overflow-y: auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        
        .chat-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        
        .code-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 0;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .chat-header, .code-header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.3);
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }
        
        .chat-header h2, .code-header h2 {
            color: var(--success);
            font-size: 22px;
        }
        
        .chat-messages {
            flex: 1;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 15px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }
        
        .message {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            max-width: 90%;
            animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
            word-wrap: break-word;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        
        .user-message {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
            margin-left: auto;
            border-bottom-right-radius: 5px;
        }
        
        .ai-message {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            margin-right: auto;
            border-bottom-left-radius: 5px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--success);
        }
        
        .code-message {
            background: var(--code-bg);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--warning);
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }
        
        .chat-input {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 15px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        
        .chat-input textarea {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 15px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border: 2px solid rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.3);
            border-radius: 12px;
            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
            resize: none;
            min-height: 60px;
            max-height: 120px;
            font-family: inherit;
        }
        
        .chat-input textarea:focus {
            border-color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .chat-input button {
            padding: 15px 25px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        
        .chat-input button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.4);
        }
        
        .chat-input button:disabled {
            opacity: 0.5;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            transform: none;
            box-shadow: none;
        }
        
        .stats-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        
        .stats-card h3 {
            color: var(--success);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 18px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        
        .stat-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        
        .stat-item span:first-child {
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
        
        .stat-item span:last-child {
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .model-selection {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        .model-option {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        .model-option:hover {
            background: rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.1);
            border-color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .model-option.active {
            background: rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.2);
            border-color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.3);
        }
        
        .model-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        
        .model-name {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--success);
        }
        
        .model-size {
            font-size: 12px;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }
        
        .model-desc {
            font-size: 13px;
            opacity: 0.8;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        
        .progress-bar {
            width: 100%;
            height: 6px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 3px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .progress-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--success));
            border-radius: 3px;
            width: 0%;
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .progress-text {
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 5px;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
        
        .controls {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        .control-btn {
            padding: 12px;
            background: rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid var(--primary);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            text-align: center;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
        }
        
        .control-btn:hover {
            background: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .control-btn.active {
            background: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.5);
        }
        
        .control-btn:disabled {
            opacity: 0.5;
            cursor: not-allowed;
        }
        
        .control-btn.loading {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .control-btn.loading::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: -100%;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), transparent);
            animation: loading 1.5s infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes loading {
            to { left: 100%; }
        }
        
        #editor {
            flex: 1;
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 400px;
        }
        
        .code-controls {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 15px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        
        .code-controls button {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background: rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid var(--primary);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            flex: 1;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        
        .code-controls button:hover {
            background: var(--primary);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        
        .code-controls button.run {
            background: rgba(76, 201, 240, 0.2);
            border-color: var(--success);
        }
        
        .code-controls button.run:hover {
            background: var(--success);
        }
        
        .code-controls button.debug {
            background: rgba(248, 150, 30, 0.2);
            border-color: var(--warning);
        }
        
        .code-controls button.debug:hover {
            background: var(--warning);
        }
        
        .code-controls button.ai {
            background: rgba(58, 12, 163, 0.2);
            border-color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .code-controls button.ai:hover {
            background: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .output-container {
            padding: 15px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            max-height: 200px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 14px;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
        }
        
        .output-success {
            color: var(--success);
        }
        
        .output-error {
            color: var(--error);
        }
        
        .output-warning {
            color: var(--warning);
        }
        
        .language-selector {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        
        .lang-btn {
            padding: 5px 15px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 13px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        .lang-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.3);
        }
        
        .lang-btn.active {
            background: var(--primary);
            border-color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .typing-indicator {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 20px;
            color: var(--success);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .typing-indicator span {
            animation: blink 1.4s infinite;
            margin: 0 2px;
        }
        
        .typing-indicator span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .typing-indicator span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
        
        @keyframes blink {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.2; }
            50% { opacity: 1; }
        }
        
        .notification {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            z-index: 1000;
            animation: slideIn 0.3s ease;
            max-width: 350px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        
        @keyframes slideIn {
            from { transform: translateX(100%); opacity: 0; }
            to { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; }
        }
        
        .system-info {
            font-size: 13px;
            opacity: 0.8;
            line-height: 1.5;
            padding: 10px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        
        .performance-metrics {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        
        .metric {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .metric-value {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--success);
        }
        
        .metric-label {
            font-size: 11px;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }
        
        .model-status {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .status-loaded {
            background: rgba(76, 201, 240, 0.2);
            color: var(--success);
        }
        
        .status-loading {
            background: rgba(248, 150, 30, 0.2);
            color: var(--warning);
        }
        
        .status-error {
            background: rgba(249, 65, 68, 0.2);
            color: var(--error);
        }
        
        .code-snippet {
            background: var(--code-bg);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: 10px 0;
            overflow-x: auto;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 14px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
        }
        
        pre {
            margin: 0;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
        }
        
        .code-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }
        
        .code-action-btn {
            padding: 5px 12px;
            background: rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid var(--primary);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 12px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        
        .code-action-btn:hover {
            background: var(--primary);
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 1400px) {
            .container {
                grid-template-columns: 350px 1fr;
                height: auto;
            }
            .code-container {
                grid-column: 1 / -1;
                height: 600px;
            }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 15px;
            }
            .code-container {
                height: 500px;
            }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .controls, .code-controls {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .language-selector {
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }
            .message {
                max-width: 95%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- الشريط الجانبي -->
        <div class="sidebar">
            <div class="stats-card">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-microchip"></i> حالة النظام البرمجي</h3>
                <div id="stats-container">
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <span>النموذج النشط:</span>
                        <span id="active-model-name">لا يوجد</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <span>حالة النموذج:</span>
                        <span id="model-status-text" class="model-status status-error">غير محمل</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <span>اللغة المحددة:</span>
                        <span id="current-language">JavaScript</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <span>السطور المبرمجة:</span>
                        <span id="lines-of-code">0</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <span>الأخطاء المكتشفة:</span>
                        <span id="errors-found">0</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="performance-metrics">
                    <div class="metric">
                        <div class="metric-value" id="cpu-usage">0%</div>
                        <div class="metric-label">استخدام CPU</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric">
                        <div class="metric-value" id="memory-usage">0 MB</div>
                        <div class="metric-label">الذاكرة</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="stats-card">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-robot"></i> نماذج البرمجة</h3>
                <div class="model-selection">
                    <div class="model-option active" onclick="selectModel('codegen')" id="model-codegen">
                        <div class="model-info">
                            <span class="model-name">CodeGen 350M</span>
                            <span class="model-size">~350MB</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="model-desc">
                            توليد أكواد بـ 16 لغة برمجة، تدعم العربية في التوثيق
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-bar" id="progress-codegen">
                            <div class="progress-fill"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-text" id="progress-text-codegen">غير محمل</div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="model-option" onclick="selectModel('incoder')" id="model-incoder">
                        <div class="model-info">
                            <span class="model-name">InCoder 1B</span>
                            <span class="model-size">~1GB</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="model-desc">
                            إكمال وتصحيح الأكواد، يملأ الأجزاء الناقصة
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-bar" id="progress-incoder">
                            <div class="progress-fill"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-text" id="progress-text-incoder">غير محمل</div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="model-option" onclick="selectModel('starcoder')" id="model-starcoder">
                        <div class="model-info">
                            <span class="model-name">StarCoderBase</span>
                            <span class="model-size">~800MB</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="model-desc">
                            نموذج متقدم، يدعم 80+ لغة برمجة
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-bar" id="progress-starcoder">
                            <div class="progress-fill"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-text" id="progress-text-starcoder">غير محمل</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="controls">
                    <button class="control-btn" id="load-btn" onclick="loadSelectedModel()">
                        <i class="fas fa-download"></i>
                        <span>تحميل النموذج</span>
                    </button>
                    <button class="control-btn" id="unload-btn" onclick="unloadModel()" disabled>
                        <i class="fas fa-ban"></i>
                        <span>إلغاء التحميل</span>
                    </button>
                    <button class="control-btn" onclick="clearCodeEditor()">
                        <i class="fas fa-broom"></i>
                        <span>مسح المحرر</span>
                    </button>
                    <button class="control-btn" onclick="saveProject()">
                        <i class="fas fa-save"></i>
                        <span>حفظ المشروع</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="stats-card">
                <h3><i class="fas fa-code"></i> قوالب جاهزة</h3>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
                    <button class="lang-btn" onclick="loadTemplate('html_template')">موقع ويب HTML/CSS/JS</button>
                    <button class="lang-btn" onclick="loadTemplate('python_template')">برنامج Python</button>
                    <button class="lang-btn" onclick="loadTemplate('react_template')">مكون React</button>
                    <button class="lang-btn" onclick="loadTemplate('node_template')">خادم Node.js</button>
                    <button class="lang-btn" onclick="loadTemplate('algorithm_template')">خوارزمية بحث</button>
                </div>
                
                <div class="system-info">
                    <p><strong>المميزات:</strong></p>
                    <ul style="padding-right: 15px; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px;">
                        <li>توليد أكواد ذكي</li>
                        <li>تصحيح أخطاء تلقائي</li>
                        <li>تنفيذ مباشر في المتصفح</li>
                        <li>دعم 16 لغة برمجة</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- منطقة المحادثة -->
        <div class="chat-container">
            <div class="chat-header">
                <h2><i class="fas fa-comments"></i> مساعد البرمجة الذكي</h2>
                <p style="opacity: 0.7; margin-top: 5px;">اسأل عن البرمجة، اطلب أكواد، احصل على حلول</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="chat-messages" id="chat-messages">
                <div class="message ai-message">
                    <strong>المساعد:</strong> مرحباً! أنا مساعد برمجة متخصص. يمكنني:
                    <ul style="margin-right: 20px; margin-top: 10px;">
                        <li>كتابة أكواد برمجية</li>
                        <li>شرح مفاهيم البرمجة</li>
                        <li>تصحيح الأخطاء</li>
                        <li>تحسين الكود</li>
                        <li>كتابة توثيق عربي</li>
                    </ul>
                    <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.8;">
                        حمل نموذجاً من القائمة الجانبية للبدء.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="chat-input">
                <textarea id="message-input" 
                          placeholder="اكتب سؤالك البرمجي أو اطلب كوداً... (اضغط Ctrl+Enter للإرسال)"
                          rows="2"></textarea>
                <button id="send-btn" onclick="sendMessage()" disabled>
                    <i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> إرسال
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- منطقة الأكواد -->
        <div class="code-container">
            <div class="code-header">
                <h2><i class="fas fa-code"></i> محرر الأكواد المتقدم</h2>
